# Source downloads for the resource palettes (~19 GB of atlas posters and data
# rasters) and the script that reads them. Neither is required by any licence:
# compliance lives in each palette's meta.license / meta.attribution and in
# inst/NOTICE, all of which ship. data-raw is .Rbuildignore'd too.
data-raw/**

# ...except the OWID dataset script, which anyone can run: it downloads a public
# CSV and is how data/owid_energy_mix.rda was built.
!data-raw/prepare_owid_energy_mix.R
